flowchart TD
    S([Start]) --> O[Open Road Sign Game page]
    O --> G[Select game set]
    G --> I[/Display instructions/]
    I --> ST[Click Start Game]
    ST --> A1((A))

    A2((A)) --> SC[/Display road scene/]
    SC --> CK[Click a road sign in the scene]
    CK --> Q[/Display question with options A, B and C/]
    Q --> SA[Select an answer]
    SA --> FB[/Display feedback and explanation/]
    FB --> AL{All signs found?}
    AL -->|No| SC
    AL -->|Yes| CS[Calculate score]
    CS --> SV[Save attempt to database]
    SV --> RS[/Display result/]
    RS --> RA{Result action?}
    RA -->|Review Answers| RV[/Display answer review/]
    RV --> E([End])
    RA -->|Try Again| SC
    RA -->|Next Set or Back to Game| E
